---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const sections = [
	{
		title: 'Analytics and telemetry',
		body: [
			'We record anonymous interaction events and model parameters to check calculator accuracy and improve the engines. We do not sell personal data or run cross-site tracking scripts.',
			'Concretely, using an interactive asset may record: which asset was opened, when, the names of the input fields you changed and how many, the page you arrived from, your approximate viewport width, a timestamp, and a random identifier that lasts for the open tab. That identifier counts one visit instead of counting reloads; your browser generates it, it is stored nowhere else, and it is not linked to your name. We do not record the values you type, your name or your address. These events use no cookies.'
		]
	},
	{
		title: 'Your calculator inputs',
		body: [
			'Multivariable engines save your inputs in your own browser (localStorage) so a return visit resumes where you left off. That data never leaves your device unless you ask us to email a scenario. Start fresh, clear site data, or use a private window to remove it.'
		]
	},
	{
		title: 'Email',
		body: [
			'Email is optional and only requested after a model is complete, never as a gate. If you ask for a scenario report we store your address with the scenario, use it to send that report, and nothing else. You can unsubscribe at any time; asking us to delete the record removes it.'
		]
	},
	{
		title: 'Retention and requests',
		body: [
			'Interaction events are kept for up to 24 months in aggregate form. Email records are kept until you unsubscribe or ask for deletion. To request a copy or deletion of anything tied to your address, write to privacy@wellroost.com.'
		]
	},
	{
		title: 'Changes',
		body: [
			'If what we collect changes, this page changes with it and the effective date moves. The date is the version recorded alongside any email you submit, so a record always answers to the notice it was given under.'
		]
	}
];
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Privacy | WellRoost"
	description="What WellRoost records when you use the decision engines, what it does not, and how to turn any of it off."
>
	<article class="wrap pt-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)]">
		<h1 class="display max-w-[15ch] text-ink">What we record, and what we do not.</h1>
		<p class="lede mt-8 max-w-[48ch]">
			Effective 20 October 2026. The short version: the calculators work without handing over
			anything, the numbers you type stay in your browser, and there are no advertising networks here.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-14 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.4fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-20">
			<ul class="grid content-start gap-2 text-[0.875rem] text-ink-2">
				{sections.map((section) => (
					<li>{section.title}</li>
				))}
			</ul>

			<div class="grid max-w-[36rem] gap-10">
				{sections.map((section) => (
					<section>
						<h2 class="font-display text-[1.5rem] leading-tight text-ink">{section.title}</h2>
						{section.body.map((paragraph) => (
							<p class="mt-3 text-[1rem] leading-relaxed text-ink">{paragraph}</p>
						))}
					</section>
				))}
			</div>
		</div>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
